    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nAn opportunity to purchase a 3 bedroom detached house in Cluainin Na MBo, Enniscrone Co Sligo. This property is just a few minutes' walk from Enniscrone Beach and Pier. Enniscrone is on the Wild Atlantic Way and is renowned for the most wonderful sunsets and 5km of white sandy beach, Water Park, Surf Schools, Seaweed Baths, Kids Playground and the renowned 18 hole Championship Links Golf Course. \n\nAccommodation consists of kitchen, living/dining room, double bedroom, family bathroom complete the ground floor, On the first floor there is a further 2 double bedrooms one with sea view and bathroom. \n\nThere is a large garden to the rear of the property that is not overlooked. Oil fired central heating system and Solid Fuel Stove in living area. There is ample parking to the side of the property. \n\nSituated near the county border with Mayo, just 10 km from Ballina and 56km from Sligo, the town's location makes it the perfect base for exploring the beautiful landscapes counties Sligo and Mayo have to offer.\n\nKnock International Airport is 53km via the R297 and N17 from this property.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 6.17m x 2.03m\n\n\nLiving Room - 3.93m x 7.58m\n\n\nKitchen - 3.06m x 4.91m\n\n\nHall - 3.45m x 0.99m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.32m x 3.92m\n\n\nBathroom - 3.06m x 1.70m\nBath, w.c., w.h.b.\n\nLanding - 3.98m x 1.78m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.91m x 4.43m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.42m x 4.44m\n\n\nShower Room - 2.66m x 1.65m\nShower, w.h.b., w.c.\n\n"
